==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a decent [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitter]] and you'll win.

